*.pbxuser
xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
.DS_Store
*.xcarchive
Build/
node_modules/

# NOT `*.xcworkspace`. That pattern matches the `project.xcworkspace` directory
# *inside* `hoopr.xcodeproj`, which swallowed
# `xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved` — so the SPM dependency pins were
# untracked and a fresh clone re-resolved `upToNextMajorVersion` to whatever
# was current that day. The per-user state under a workspace is already covered
# by the `xcuserdata/` rule above, which matches at any depth.
